														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2228695">
									

<p>As far as I'm concerned, those comments aren't particularly bad. If nothing else, they help to drive home the message that people, rather than a single particular individual who actually bothered to post in-depth critique, think the article is bad.</p>
<p>See, writing is a performance sport. (in terms of our site's enviroment) If one person thinks your work is shit, well, no big deal. If a dozen do so, you may have a problem. If a hundred do, you've definitely fucked up.</p>

